Requirements
A customer can insert their card into the ATM.
The ATM should validate the card.
The customer should enter their PIN.
The system should authenticate the customer using the PIN.
After successful authentication, the customer should be able to:
Check balance
Withdraw cash
Deposit cash
Transfer money
Change PIN
Eject card
For cash withdrawal:
Check whether the account has sufficient balance.
Check whether the ATM has sufficient cash.
Dispense the requested amount.
Deduct the amount from the user's account.
The ATM should support different denominations of notes.


